      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There's a larger problem in that there's two separate workflows present in reporting someone for moderation, where one points to the web browser and the other fills it within the client itself, depending on the conditions of the report.\n\nI'd be more inclined to fix the workflow and standardize to the internal game client reporting version myself.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-09-16T16:02:32.821Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Right now when you report a user, it opens up a web browser with a form to fill out. However, this form is completely empty, and the “username” fields can often be difficult or impossible to fill out, due to the proliferation of Unicode characters and weird spellings in display names.\n\nIt would be extremely helpful if the form were opened with the username fields (yours and the person you’re reporting) already filled in.",
